    "Id": "mechdef_rabid_coyote_RB-PW",
    "Name": "Rabid Coyote PW",
    "Details": "Refitted for the front line warriors that did not like the original concept, this Rabid Coyote variant now fields 36 Tubes of Streak SRM's, and 2 complementary Small Pulse Lasers. Not a lot has changed otherwise, still the same amount of armor and speed. Four tons of ammo supply this Mech with enough firepower, while the upgrades make sure that the streaks are faster at target acquisition.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Short</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.17</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_rabidcoyote"
  },
